  "body": [
    "Careers",
    "What We are Working on",
    "How do we at Continental create added value for industry and society? What innovations are changing our mobility? How can sustainability and production go profitably hand in hand? Continental provides its customers with a wide range of products and solutions to create a global impact. Get an insight into our diversity.",
    "Directly to the job portal",
    "Continental also uses its innovative strength to develop new types of materials. High-performance composite materials, coupled with our demanding material testing and optimization, create competitive advantages for our customers and protect the environment.",
    "Find out more",
    "Continental always has the right solution for the diverse needs of different industries and optimizes production technology, robotics, automation solutions, drives, and much more in order to ensure sustainable and more efficient production.",
    "Find out more",
    "Get things rolling with Continental! Work on advanced tires for a wide range of applications and contribute to the development of high-quality tire solutions for cars, trucks, and bicycles!",
    "Find out more",
    "Create smart tire systems and continue to advance tire technology at Continental as part of our team. For us, everything revolves around the future!",
    "Find out more",
    "The day-to-day work of our experts ensures that innovations can be created. Discover of our diverse professional fields of work.",
    "Discover Continental as an employer and find out about the corporate culture, career opportunities and other benefits.",
    "Select your career level here and discover suitable entry opportunities that allow you to make a flying start at Continental."
